+- `source-fetch-check`: four page-source records fetch-verified, zero drops. The two unique full texts were each fetched once on each page: `https://arxiv.org/pdf/1412.5148` (77 pages, 648,499 bytes, SHA256 prefix `40b591074a5932d8`) and `https://arxiv.org/pdf/1607.05747` (42 pages, 508,724 bytes, SHA256 prefix `60f2025287549d86`). No retrieval failures occurred; `source_resolution` is empty. The search queries, exact locators, supported items, reading extents, limitations, and dispositions are in the batch coverage file.
+- Scoped statement-first inspection: all five item statements have zero defects. A separate frontmatter-only check confirms both page bodies are empty.
